{"scope":"rt-2e5c28a6f3","css":".rt-2e5c28a6f3 p.MsoNormal, .rt-2e5c28a6f3 li.MsoNormal, .rt-2e5c28a6f3 div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-2e5c28a6f3 h3 {margin:0cm; text-align:center; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:14.0pt; font-family:\"Courier New\"; text-decoration:underline;}\n.rt-2e5c28a6f3 p.MsoPlainText, .rt-2e5c28a6f3 li.MsoPlainText, .rt-2e5c28a6f3 div.MsoPlainText {mso-style-link:\"Plain Text Char\"; margin:0cm; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Courier New\";}\n.rt-2e5c28a6f3 span.PlainTextChar {mso-style-name:\"Plain Text Char\"; mso-style-link:\"Plain Text\"; font-family:\"Courier New\";}\n.rt-2e5c28a6f3 div.WordSection1 {}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657728;left:-52px;\r\ntop:18px;width:994px;height:20px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAADiAwIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsChwaiUYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytNwEoAAA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>DEPARTMENT OF RADIOLOGY\r\n&amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span lang=EN-US>RADIOGRAPH OF RIGHT\/LEFT SHOULDER JOINT AP\/LAT<\/span><\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n--------No obvious bony injury or abnormality seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nNo obvious periarticular calcific fleck is visualised.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n--------Gleno-humeral and acromio-clavicular joint spaces are<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\u00a0preserved.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n--------Soft tissue planes around shoulder joint are intact.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 IMPRESSION<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 : NORMAL STUDY.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nDR.\u00a0 S.\u00a0 BHATTACHARYA<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nMD [RADIOLOGY]<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>Checked\r\nby\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 CONSULTANT RADIOLOGIST<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n-------Mild irregularity with sclerosis at greater<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\ntuberosity of left humerus and left acromion <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nprocess.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText style='text-indent:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:12.0pt'>--------Changes due to osteoarthrosis are seen <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 in\r\ngleno-humeral joint.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"151.2pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}